  "title": "Hallway To Nowhere",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "Hallway To Nowhere is a microfiction horror podcast about isolation, escape, and that which is almost familiar. The story follows Jessica, a young woman trapped in a series of endless hallways. Only Nocturn and Oasis, two cold AIs, are there to keep her company. Jessica is just about to give up, until she comes across a mysterious device. Through this device, Jessica meets Iris, a kind and caring voice that promises to guide her to freedom. As they traverse through increasingly surreal yet familiar levels, Jessica finally feels hope that she’ll be free once more. But Nocturn and Oasis have other ideas in store…",
